GREYWARD BRANDING NOTICE

The GREYWARD and MANTIS SYSTEMS names, GREYWARD logos, symbol, wordmarks,
lockups, wallpapers, and their generated/copy forms are
designated product identity material. They are not included in the repository's
general GPL-3.0-only grant, to the extent MANTIS SYSTEMS owns the relevant
rights. All rights in that material are reserved except as required by law or
allowed by separate written permission.

GPL-covered source forks remain permitted under the GPL. This notice does not
restrict truthful references to GREYWARD where legally permitted, but modified
distributions must not imply official status or endorsement and do not
automatically receive permission to use GREYWARD branding as their identity.

This notice does not apply to third-party fonts, icons, marks, or artwork. Those
items retain their own terms. See ../THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and
